  "ai.orion81Builds": "I-Orion-81 yakhelwe phezu kwesofthiwe evulekile ebhalwe abantu. Ibhalwe lapha ngoba ayenziwanga nge-AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>I-Orion-81 iwumsebenzi owenziwe ngokuphelele yi-AI.<\/0> Wonke umugqa wekhodi ye-Orion-81 uqobo wabhalwa nge-Claude Code, iqondiswa ngumsunguli. Wonke umkhumbi, imephu, ithekisitshi nomsindo kwakhiqizwa amathuluzi abhalwa yi-Claude Code. Umsunguli unquma ukuthi yini okufanele yakhiwe; i-Claude Code ithola ukuthi kwenziwa kanjani. Imitapo evulekile eyakhelwe phezu kwayo ibhalwe ngezansi ngaphansi kuka-'Okungenziwe nge-AI'. Into eyodwa isavulekile futhi iboniswa ngokusobala: <1>ukubuyekezwa kwelayisense<\/1> yekhodi yegeyimu eyeza evela kumodeli yokuqala ye-GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "I-Orion yaqala zingama-28 Septhemba 2026 njengesibonelo sokuqala kunjini evulekile ye-Quake III Arena (GPL), inemikhumbi evela ku-Elite Dangerous njengomthombo wokugqugquzela. Ngosuku lwesibili ikhodi yegeyimu yathuthelwa ku-BuB, injini entsha ebhalwe nge-Claude Code; amamojuli egeyimu avela kusibonelo sokuqala futhi aqanjwa amagama amasha. Ukukhululwa kwe-0.3.0 kunike zonke izigaba ezingu-16 zemikhumbi izigobongo ezintsha ezizodwa. Ukubuyekezwa kokulandela umthetho welayisense kuhlola ukuthi ingabe ikhodi ethile isesuselwe kwi-GPL yasekuqaleni yini, nokuthi ingabe imiklamo yokuqala yemikhumbi isondele kakhulu yini kumthombo wokugqugquzela. Ukuskena okuzenzakalelayo kokufana kwekhodi nomthombo wesibonelo sokuqala se-GPL kwenziwa mhla ka-8 Okthoba 2026, futhi ukubuyekezwa kochwepheshe kwemidlalo efanayo kuyaqhubeka. Noma yini esuselwe kwenye iyobhalwa kabusha noma iklanywe kabusha.",
