  "economy.todayHead": "Okukhona namuhla",
  "economy.todayLead": "Amazinga esigobongo nesihlangu nemibala yesihlangu yesikrini se-LOADOUT (0.6.0) kubonisa uhlobo lokuthuthukiswa nokuhlobisa umnotho ohloselwe ukunikeza.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Ngoba imali yayo ihloselwe ukubakhokhela. Igeyimu iqala yenziwe ngokuphelele nge-AI ukuze ikwazi ukuba khona, bese abaklami abakhokhelwayo bethatha indawo yomsebenzi we-AI, bebhekwa ngamagama.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ngingadlala ku-inthanethi?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Ingabe imahhala ukudlala?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Imibuzo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Hhayi okwamanje. Umdlalo wabadlali abaningi we-LAN kunethiwekhi efanayo uyasebenza namuhla (kusukela ku-0.2.0); umdlalo ku-inthanethi awukakhiwa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Isibonelo sokuqala sakhiwa kunjini evulekile ye-Quake III Arena (GPL) futhi sathatha imikhumbi ye-Elite Dangerous njengomthombo wokugqugquzela. Ngosuku lwesibili ikhodi yegeyimu yathuthelwa ku-BuB, injini entsha ebhalwe nge-Claude Code; amamojuli egeyimu avela kusibonelo sokuqala futhi aqanjwa amagama amasha. Ukukhululwa kwe-0.3.0 kunike zonke izigaba ezingu-16 zemikhumbi izigobongo ezintsha. Ukubuyekezwa kokulandela umthetho welayisense kuhlola ukuthi ingabe ikhodi ethile isesuselwe kwi-GPL yasekuqaleni yini nokuthi ingabe imiklamo yokuqala yemikhumbi isondele kakhulu yini kumthombo wokugqugquzela. Ukuskena okuzenzakalelayo kokufana kwekhodi nomthombo wesibonelo sokuqala se-GPL kwenziwa mhla ka-<0/>, futhi ukubuyekezwa kochwepheshe kwemidlalo efanayo kuyaqhubeka. Noma yini esuselwe kwenye iyobhalwa kabusha noma iklanywe kabusha. Kuze kuphele ukubuyekezwa, asisho ukuthi impendulo ithi cha.",
  "faq.questions": "Imibuzo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Imikhumbi, ubuciko, isixhumi nokunye, njengoba imali ivuma. <0>Incwadi yezinto kuleli khasi<\/0> ibhala yonke into futhi izobonisa ukushintshwa ngakunye nomklami walo.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Imikhumbi nokuthuthukiswa kuhlelelwe ukuthi kuzuzwe ngokudlala noma kuthengwe. Ukuthi imikhumbi ekhokhelwayo ihlala inobulungisa kanjani ekulweni komdlali nomdlali kusaklanywa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Yileyo ngohlelo: mahhala ukudlala nemali yasegeyimini ekhethwa ngokuthanda nokuhlobisa. Akukakhiwa.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Ingabe umsebenzi womuntu ukopishiwe?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Iphuma nini, futhi ku-yini?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Yiziphi izingxenye abantu abazozithatha, futhi ngizokwazi kanjani?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Kungani igeyimu eyenziwe nge-AI ingasiza abaklami?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Izoba yikhokha-ukuze-uwine?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "I-Windows PC. Asikho usuku lokukhishwa futhi asikho intengo okwamanje.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "I-Anthropic, i-Claude ne-Claude Code ziyizimpawu zokuhwebelana ze-Anthropic, PBC. I-Unreal Engine ne-Epic Games ziyizimpawu zokuhwebelana ze-Epic Games, Inc. I-Blender iyisimpawu sokuhwebelana se-Blender Foundation. I-Quake III Arena ne-Elite Dangerous ziyizimpawu zokuhwebelana zabanikazi bazo. Wonke amagama angawabanikazi bawo futhi asetshenziselwa kuphela ukuhlonza imikhiqizo ekhulunywa ngayo. I-Orion-81 ayixhumene nabo, ayixhaswa, noma ayisekelwa yinoma yimuphi wabo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Okuhlosiwe. Akukho ubambiswano, ukuxhumana noma ukwesekelwa okukhona.",
