  "why.anthropic": "Ku-Anthropic",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>I-Economic Index ye-Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> ithola ukuthi abasebenzi abasanda kuqala umsebenzi babona okuningi komsebenzi wabo kungenziwa yi-AI.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Uhlaka lwenqubomgomo yezomnotho ye-Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> licela amafemu ukuthi aqeqeshe kabusha futhi abeke kabusha abantu esikhundleni sokubanciphisa.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Ukubuyekezwa kobufakazi bokuqeqeshwa kabusha ye-Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> kuthola ukuthi izinhlelo ezixhumene nomqashi, ezigxile emkhakheni zisebenza kangcono kakhulu.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "Isicelo silula: izihlalo ezinhlanu ze-Claude ukuqala. Uma umsunguli engazigcwalisa ngabantu abanekhono nabakhuthele, sizobonisa ukuthi i-AI ingasetshenziswa kanjani ngenhloso enhle ukwenza into enhle.",
  "why.context": "Umongo",
  "why.designersEngineers": "Kubaklami nonjiniyela",
  "why.everyItemBelow": "Yonke into engezansi iyihlelo noma isazomenyezelwa. Akukho okuvunyelwene lapha, futhi azikho izibalo ezethenjisiwe.",
  "why.founderWentFrom": "Umsunguli uphume kusibonelo sokuqala wafika ku-0.6.1 ezinsukwini ezingu-<0/>. Cabanga ukuthi iqembu elizinikele lamalungu amahlanu lingenzani.",
  "why.fromAnthropic": "Evela ku-Anthropic",
  "why.fromBackers": "Evela kubaxhasi",
  "why.fullyDisclosedAi": "Igeyimu eyenziwe nge-AI ekhonjiswe ngokuphelele enenhloso abadlali abangayihlola, ehlelelwe ukuthuthela ku-Unreal Engine 5 (isigaba 3 soHlelo-ndlela).",
  "why.fullyDocumentedExample": "Isibonelo esibhalwe ngokuphelele sokwakha nge-AI esebenza ngokuzimela, kusukela enjinini kuya egeyimini (indawo yokugcina, i-tracker nayo yonke inguqulo eqandisiwe kugciniwe), nesivivinyo esincane nesisebenzisekayo sendlela eyodwa izinzuzo ze-AI ezingaxhasa ngayo abantu ezibakhipha emisebenzini.",
  "why.fundingGoalAnnounced": "Inhloso yokuxhasa: izomenyezelwa.",
  "why.kickstarterRoadmapPhase": "I-Kickstarter (isigaba 5 soHlelo-ndlela) ingumjikelezo wokuqala wokuqongelela imali yomphakathi. Imali yayo ihloselwe ukuqasha abathuthukisi abokuqala nabaklami bemifanekiso abalahlekelwe umsebenzi ngenxa ye-AI (isigaba 6), abazobe sebethatha indawo yezinto ezenziwe nge-AI eyodwa ngayodwa. <0>Ukuthi umjikelezo wokuqala ukhokhela ini, indima ngendima: kuzomenyezelwa.<\/0>",
  "why.linksContextOnly": "Izixhumanisi ziwumongo kuphela futhi azisho ukwesekelwa.",
  "why.n06WhyMatters": "06 · Kungani kubalulekile",
  "why.orion81Tests": "I-Orion-81 ihlola inguqulo eyodwa encane yaleyo mibono. Iyihlelo, ayikabi nabaqashiwe.",
  "why.plannedPaidCredited": "Kuhlelwe: umsebenzi ohlawulelwayo onikezwa isithunzi uthatha indawo yezinto ezenziwe nge-AI eyodwa ngayodwa, njengoba imali ivuma.",
  "why.publishersEngineMakers": "Kubashicileli nabenzi benjini",
  "why.routesThatExist": "Izindlela ezikhona ezinhlelweni zomphakathi ze-Anthropic zifaka i-Claude for Startups (amakhredithi namahora ehhovisi e-Applied AI) nemicimbi ye-Claude Founder House. I-Orion-81 ingaba futhi indawo yocwaningo kubacwaningi abafunda ngokuqashwa kabusha okuxhaswe yi-AI. Akukho sivumelwano noma ukwesekelwa okukhona.",
